# Ticket Progress

After a significant implementation or review milestone, assess whether tracker
progress needs communicating. When it does, invoke `update-ticket` to draft the
update and obtain user approval before posting.

Before: implementation finishes and the ticket receives no progress update.

After: implementation finishes, the agent invokes `update-ticket`, presents the
proposed update, and posts it only after approval.
